    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the first day at a new school, the transfer student meets &quot;Freya,&quot; the girl sitting next to them, who has a uniquely special aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Called by a teacher, the transfer student ends up leaving school late in the evening</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school gates are locked, and inside, the transfer student encounters Freya again, but something about her seems a little strange...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/1a9b8924389b0e7d712d34eb5c18fc63.poster.avif?t=1755575283\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/1a9b8924389b0e7d712d34eb5c18fc63.webm?t=1755575283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/1a9b8924389b0e7d712d34eb5c18fc63.mp4?t=1755575283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[How to Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the locked school by solving puzzles while running away from Freya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/76d22d2f75838b530ddfc60e36a1926f.poster.avif?t=1755575283\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/76d22d2f75838b530ddfc60e36a1926f.webm?t=1755575283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604030/extras/76d22d2f75838b530ddfc60e36a1926f.mp4?t=1755575283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp